3	// Cold Email Engine — Master Inbox + webhook server actions (Overhaul Phase 1).
4	//
5	// Every action re-checks requireArea("platform"). The reply-send path is a normal
6	// 1:1 email to an EXISTING conversation (someone who already replied to us) sent
7	// from that inbox's own SMTP — it never touches the bulk queue, so it is allowed
8	// while the bulk kill-switch is OFF. Webhook signing secrets are stored ENCRYPTED.
