1051	// Real DNS lookups, NOT self-attested checkboxes. The records are read through
1052	// the zone's AUTHORITATIVE nameservers (lib/mail/deliverability.ts) rather than
1053	// the local resolver — this host's /etc/hosts once produced a confidently wrong
1054	// diagnosis, so cold-email verification must never trust the system resolver.
1055	// The pure recognition lives in lib/coldemail/dns.ts and is unit-tested.
1056	// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
