362	/**
363	 * Test a rule as a DRY-RUN. Pulls the account's campaign-scope insights over the
364	 * rule's lookback window, runs the pure evaluator, and records an AdsRuleRun
365	 * with the human note of what it WOULD do. Executes NO platform mutation.
